OL,3,GNEWSAWorker left unable to communicate
OL,4,Aafter load fell
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm admitted breaching the Health
OL,7,Fand Safety at Work Act and was fined
OL,8,F#4m at Birmingham Magistrates' Court on
OL,9,FFriday. The company was also ordered to
OL,10,Fpay #6,304 in costs.
